A '''labyrinth of rock pinnacles''' sat upon an [[Unidentified barren moon|unnamed moon]]<ref name="Sideshow" /> that was filled by such rocky spires.<ref name="Part VI Slide">{{SW|url=series/obi-wan-kenobi/part-vi-guide|text=Obi-Wan Kenobi: Part VI Episode Guide}} {{C|Story Gallery Slide 3}}</ref> The labyrinth was next to the moon's<ref name="Part VI">{{Kenobi|Part VI}}</ref> [[Unidentified barren moon's dry lands|dry lands]].<ref name="Sideshow" /> When [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] and [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] faced each other on the moon, the field of rocks became site to a [[Fight on a barren moon|historic lightsaber duel]].<ref name="Barren Moon">{{Databank|barren-moon|barren moon}}</ref>

